<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:48:38 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>我测试了一家人工智能初创公司，该公司声称其盈利可以超过华尔街的预期。 50次中赢了40次</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/quarterly-earnings-ai-vs-analysts-samaya/</link><description>许多首席执行官的生死存亡取决于季度盈利目标的实现。一家名为 Samaya 的人工智能初创公司刚刚对这些目标提出了质疑。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305716813.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/quarterly-earnings-ai-vs-analysts-samaya/</guid></item><item><title>iPhone 设计师 Tony Fadell 的下一件大事：将人工智能引入时尚界，希望每年为 H&amp;amp;M 节省 1 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/smartex-ai-tony-fadell-fashion-hm/</link><description>“如果你了解任何一种[时尚]供应链，无论是面料生产还是服装生产，大多数人都会对它的混乱程度感到惊讶。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2245895524.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:06:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/smartex-ai-tony-fadell-fashion-hm/</guid></item><item><title>Anthrotic 股票在大型 IPO 中市值飙升 30% 至 2 万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/anthropic-ipo-first-day-trading-nasdaq-record-valuation/</link><description>在华尔街的首次亮相立即使这家成立五年的人工智能公司跻身万亿美元上市公司的精英俱乐部。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305298299-e1795102326650.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:28:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/anthropic-ipo-first-day-trading-nasdaq-record-valuation/</guid></item><item><title>威瑞森的首席执行官知道埃隆·马斯克会来抢他的生意。他表示 SpaceX 将花费超过 3000 亿美元来竞争</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/verizon-ceo-elon-musk-spacex-starlink-mobile-cost-300-billion-dollars/</link><description>“没有秘方，没有魔杖，也没有结构性成本优势，”丹·舒尔曼告诉《财富》杂志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2297384912-e1795104357824.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:46:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/verizon-ceo-elon-musk-spacex-starlink-mobile-cost-300-billion-dollars/</guid></item><item><title>不要仅仅使用人工智能来削减成本。用它来创造增长</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/16/idealab-ai-create-growth-bill-gross-productivity/</link><description>人工智能正在使想法变得更加丰富，并使早期实验的成本变得更加便宜。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/bill-gross-headshot-idealab.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:06:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/16/idealab-ai-create-growth-bill-gross-productivity/</guid></item><item><title>想构建AI运营模式？一、凝聚共识</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/ai-operating-model-build-consensus-ibm/</link><description>最好的人工智能领导者——无论是首席运营官、首席信息官还是首席信息官——都拥有一套传统的技能：在团队之间建立共识。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2277251072.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:53:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/ai-operating-model-build-consensus-ibm/</guid></item><item><title>继 SpaceX 遭遇类似失败后，加密货币平台为 Anthropic IPO 提供代币化股票的计划未能实现</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/crypto-platforms-offer-tokenized-shares-anthropic-ipo-similar-spacex-flop/</link><description>加密代币可以让投资者有机会获得 IPO 价格，但强劲的需求使平台上的股票短缺。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305894185-e1795110004627.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:41:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/crypto-platforms-offer-tokenized-shares-anthropic-ipo-similar-spacex-flop/</guid></item><item><title>今年 10 人份的感恩节晚餐价格为 78.93 美元，比疫情爆发前上涨了约 25%，其中新鲜火鸡价格上涨了 11%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/thanksgiving-dinner-cost-2026-turkey-prices/</link><description>冷冻火鸡平均价格为每磅 0.96 美元，与去年基本持平，鸡蛋价格便宜 20.3%，卷心菜价格上涨约 30%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-1433453917-e1764175829248.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:35:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/thanksgiving-dinner-cost-2026-turkey-prices/</guid></item><item><title>微软的 Outlook 故障修复后并没有结束——积压的重试电子邮件可能需要数小时到数天的时间才能清除</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/microsoft-365-outlook-outage-email-backlog/</link><description>11 月 12 日开始的中断影响了世界各地企业、政府和学校的 Teams、Copilot 和 Outlook。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2286465773-e1785090144731.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:34:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/microsoft-365-outlook-outage-email-backlog/</guid></item><item><title>埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 在共和党中期选举失败后花费 4.45 亿美元，从“黑暗的 MAGA”变成了“非 MAGA”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/elon-musk-not-maga-445-million-election-spending-midterms/</link><description>这位亿万富翁表示，他对自己的政治支出感到“非常愚蠢”，甚至不确定 MAGA 意味着什么。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305782006-e1795108965359.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:33:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/19/elon-musk-not-maga-445-million-election-spending-midterms/</guid></item></channel></rss>